    name: { de: "Bui-Schlucht", hu: "Bui-szurdok", ro: "Cheile Bui", en: "Bui Gorge" },
    description: { de: "Eine durch den Schwarzen Volta geformte Schlucht.", hu: "A Fekete-Volta által formált szurdok.", ro: "O cheie formată de râul Volta Negru.", en: "A gorge formed by the Black Volta." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Ort eines Wasserkraftwerks.", "Steile Felswände.", "Reiches Wildleben.", "Landschaftlich beeindruckend."],
      hu: ["Vízerőmű helyszíne.", "Meredek sziklafalak.", "Gazdag vadvilág.", "Tájilag lenyűgöző."],
      ro: ["Locația unei hidrocentrale.", "Pereți stâncoși abrupți.", "Faună bogată.", "Impresionant peisagistic."],
      en: ["Site of a hydroelectric power plant.", "Steep rock walls.", "Rich wildlife.", "Scenically impressive."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/bui-gorge-relief-v2.webp",
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Die Bui-Schlucht (Bui Gorge) war vor dem Dammbau eine der dramatischsten landschaftlichen Einkerbungen im Black Volta-Flusssystem. Hier hatte sich der gewaltige Fluss über Jahrtausende durch harte Gesteinsschichten gefressen und steile, fast vertikale Felswände hinterlassen. Diese enge natürliche Flaschenhals-Topografie machte die Schlucht zur idealen, aber ökologisch umstrittenen Position für die Errichtung der riesigen Bui-Staumauer im Jahr 2013. Geografie K7 — Flusserosion und Talsperren.",
      hu: "A Bui-szurdok egy szűk, sziklás áttörés, ahol a Fekete-Volta folyó egy kemény homokkő hegyláncon vágja át magát a Bui Nemzeti Park szívében. A meredek, festői sziklafalak között rohanó folyó hatalmas vízi energiát rejtett magában, amelyet kihasználva építették meg ide a Bui Gátat. Bár a gát elárasztotta a szurdok egy részét, a megmaradt sziklás peremek ma is lenyűgöző látványt nyújtanak. Földrajz K8 — folyami szurdokok és áttörések.",
      ro: "O cheie formată de râul Volta Negru. Locația unei hidrocentrale. Pereți stâncoși abrupți. Faună bogată. Impresionant peisagistic. Astfel, locul se numără printre punctele caracteristice ale Ghanei — o țară modelată de coasta atlantică, de sistemul fluvial Volta, de moștenirea regatului Ashanti și de bogăția în cacao și aur — și oferă o imagine asupra identității regionale. Este situat în statul vest-african Ghana, pe coasta Golfului Guineei. Regiunea aparține zonei tropicale, cu sezoane ploioase și secetoase distincte. Accesibil prin rețeaua națională de drumuri care pornește din Accra.",
      en: "The Bui Gorge is a spectacular, steep-sided topographical chasm located on the border between the Bono and Savannah regions. Geologically, it was formed where the powerful Black Volta River cuts violently through the southern extension of the Banda Hills. The massive, compressed kinetic energy of the river rushing through this narrow, rocky bottleneck made it the absolute ideal geographical location for large-scale hydroelectric power generation. Consequently, the gorge was permanently altered by the construction of the Bui Dam, converting the wild, rushing rapids into a massive, placid artificial lake, while permanently submerging the gorge's original rugged floor. Geography K7 — river gorges and hydroelectricity."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Dramatische Einkerbung im Black Volta-System", "Steile, fast vertikale Felswände", "Geformt durch Jahrtausende Flusserosion", "Natürliche Flaschenhals-Topografie", "Ideal für den Bau der Bui-Staumauer (2013)", "Ehemaliger Standort der Schlucht"],
      hu: ["A szurdok egy ősi kvarchomokkő (quartzite) vonulat áttörésével jött létre", "Már az 1920-as években (brit mérnökök) kinézték, mint ideális helyszínt egy vízerőműnek", "Az itt megépült Bui Dam 2013-ban kezdett áramot termelni (400 MW)", "A szurdok eredetileg hatalmas víziló-csordáknak (hippos) és majmoknak adott otthont", "A duzzasztás miatt a folyó vízszintje drasztikusan megemelkedett a szorosban", "Geológiailag a Volta-medence nyugati peremvidékéhez (Banda Hills) tartozik"],
      ro: ["Locația unei hidrocentrale.", "Pereți stâncoși abrupți.", "Faună bogată.", "Impresionant peisagistic.", "O cheie formată de râul Volta Negru.", "Este situat în statul vest-african Ghana, pe coasta Golfului Guineei.", "Regiunea aparține zonei tropicale, cu sezoane ploioase și secetoase distincte.", "Accesibil prin rețeaua națională de drumuri care pornește din Accra."],
      en: ["A deep, steep-sided topographical gorge located on the Black Volta River.", "Formed geographically where the river cuts directly through the Banda Hills.", "The narrow, rocky chasm created intense, highly compressed river rapids.", "Identified in the 1920s as the optimal site for a major hydroelectric dam.", "Permanently altered and submerged by the completion of the Bui Dam in 2013.", "Historically marked the ecological boundary between dense forest and savanna."]
    }
